				<r3d:description language="eng">The Polar Data Center (PDC) manages the Science Database among other repositories for Japanese polar research.  The Science Database is the destination repository for all Japanese Antarctic Research Expedition (JARE) data as well as the Japanese contribution to the International Polar Year (IPY) 2007-2008. Metadata are in English and Japanese, and metadata records are shared with the Global Change Master Directory.</r3d:description>
